  "description": "RassyGPT is a Runtipi-native OpenAI-compatible AI gateway and model stack designed for Ian Rasmussen's V100/P100/P40 hardware while excluding the M40 from the stack. It exposes one clean /v1 endpoint while routing to specialized local backends for chat, coding, embeddings, reranking, image, speech, and future GPU experiments.",
